    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im having a massive headache with a jenkins pipeline. the unit test stage is super flaky. it passes most of the time but then randomly fails with different errors every few builds, even though we havent touched the code at all. any idea how i can start isolating if this is an environment issue or something else?",
